                    <legend>Configuração do menu</legend>
                    <label>Título <input type="text" value="{{title}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="title"></label>
                    <label>Variável de saída <input type="text" value="{{variable}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="variable" placeholder="choice"></label>
                    <label>Seleção
                      <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="selection" data-value="{{selection}}"><option value="single">Uma opção</option><option value="multiple">Várias opções</option></select>
                    </label>
                    <label>Colunas <input type="number" min="1" max="6" value="{{columns}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="columns" data-value-type="number"></label>
                    <label>Ao cancelar
                      <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="cancelBehavior" data-value="{{cancelBehavior}}"><option value="abort">Abortar macro</option><option value="default">Usar padrão</option><option value="continue">Continuar sem atribuir</option></select>
                    </label>
                    <label>Valor padrão <input type="text" value="{{defaultValue}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="defaultValue" data-value-type="optional-string"></label>
                    <label class="full">Descrição do menu <textarea rows="2" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="description" data-preserve-leading-newline>&#xfeff;{{description}}</textarea></label>
                    <label class="full file-field">Imagem do menu
                      <span><input type="text" value="{{image}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="image"><button type="button" data-action="browse-file" data-index="{{index}}" data-step-field="image" data-file-type="image" title="Escolher imagem do menu"><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i></button></span>
                    </label>
                  </fieldset>
                  <fieldset class="macro-maker-menu-columns full">
                    <legend>Títulos e texto por coluna</legend>
                    <p class="full">Dê um título a cada coluna e escolha como os textos das opções dela serão exibidos. Isso altera só a apresentação do menu, não os valores usados nas condições.</p>
                    {{#each menuColumns}}
                      <section>
                        <strong>Coluna {{number}}</strong>
                        <label>Título
                          <input type="text" value="{{title}}" placeholder="Ex.: Tipo de ataque" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="columnSettings.{{number}}.title">
                        </label>
                        <label>Padronizar texto
                          <select data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="columnSettings.{{number}}.textTransform" data-value="{{textTransform}}">
                            <option value="none">Original</option>
                            <option value="upper">MAIÚSCULAS</option>
                            <option value="lower">minúsculas</option>
                            <option value="capitalize">Iniciais maiúsculas</option>
                          </select>
                        </label>
                      </section>
                    {{/each}}
                  </fieldset>
                  <p class="macro-maker-menu-help full"><strong>Como ligar a uma condição:</strong> este menu grava a escolha em <code>{{variable}}</code>. Para executar etapas diferentes, coloque uma etapa <strong>Ramificação</strong> depois dele e escolha a condição <strong>Opção de menu</strong>, usando essa variável na chave e o valor da opção no campo Valor.</p>
                  <div class="macro-maker-menu-editor full">
                    <header><strong>Opções do menu</strong><small>Defina rótulo, valor e imagem. Coluna vazia usa o preenchimento automático.</small></header>
                    {{#each options}}
                      <div class="macro-maker-menu-option">
                        <label>Rótulo <input type="text" value="{{label}}" placeholder="Ex.: Ataque forte" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.label"></label>
                        <label>Valor <input type="text" value="{{value}}" placeholder="Ex.: forte" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.value"></label>
                        <label>Descrição <input type="text" value="{{description}}" placeholder="Texto opcional" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.description"></label>
                        <label class="file-field">Imagem
                          <span><input type="text" value="{{image}}" placeholder="icons/..." data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.image"><button type="button" data-action="browse-file" data-index="{{../index}}" data-step-field="options.{{optionIndex}}.image" data-file-type="image" title="Escolher imagem da opção"><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i></button></span>
                        </label>
                        <label>Ícone <input type="text" value="{{icon}}" placeholder="fas fa-fire" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.icon"></label>
                        <label>Coluna <input type="number" min="1" max="6" value="{{column}}" placeholder="Automática" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="options.{{optionIndex}}.column" data-value-type="optional-number"></label>
                        <button type="button" data-action="delete-menu-option" data-index="{{../index}}" data-option-index="{{optionIndex}}" title="Remover opção"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button>
                      </div>
                    {{/each}}
                    <button type="button" data-action="add-menu-option" data-index="{{index}}"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Adicionar opção</button>
                  </div>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if isBranch}}
                  <div class="macro-maker-condition-builder full">
                    <header><strong>Decisão da ramificação</strong></header>
                    {{#each branchConditionNodes}}
                      <div class="macro-maker-condition-node" style="margin-left: {{indent}}px">
                        <select data-condition-node-type data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="{{path}}.type" data-value="{{type}}"><option value="critical">Crítico</option><option value="hit">Acerto</option><option value="miss">Erro</option><option value="distance">Distância</option><option value="rollTotal">Rolagem</option><option value="damage">Dano</option><option value="naturalDie">Dado natural</option><option value="hpPercent">HP %</option><option value="hasItem">Item</option><option value="hasEffect">Efeito</option><option value="hasTag">Tag</option><option value="targetCount">Alvos</option><option value="variable">Variável</option><option value="menuOption">Opção de menu</option><option value="group">Grupo</option></select>
                        {{#if isGroup}}
                          <select data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="{{path}}.operator" data-value="{{operator}}"><option value="and">AND</option><option value="or">OR</option><option value="not">NOT</option></select>
                          <button type="button" data-action="add-condition" data-index="{{../index}}" data-path="{{path}}.children"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button>
                        {{else}}
                          <select data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="{{path}}.operator" data-value="{{operator}}"><option value="eq">=</option><option value="neq">≠</option><option value="gt">&gt;</option><option value="gte">≥</option><option value="lt">&lt;</option><option value="lte">≤</option><option value="includes">Contém</option></select>
                          <input type="text" value="{{key}}" placeholder="Variável/chave" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="{{path}}.key">
                          <input type="text" value="{{value}}" placeholder="Valor" data-step-index="{{../index}}" data-step-path="{{path}}.value">
                        {{/if}}
                        {{#if deletable}}<button type="button" data-action="delete-condition" data-index="{{../index}}" data-path="{{path}}"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button>{{/if}}
                      </div>
                    {{/each}}
                  </div>
                  <div class="macro-maker-branch-lanes full">
                    <section class="then"><h4><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Então</h4>{{#each thenSteps}}<div class="branch-step"><span>{{type}} — {{label}}</span><button type="button" data-action="delete-branch-step" data-index="{{../index}}" data-lane="then" data-branch-index="{{branchIndex}}"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button></div>{{/each}}<div class="branch-add"><select data-branch-step-type="{{index}}-then">{{#each ../stepTypes}}<option value="{{type}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="add-branch-step" data-index="{{index}}" data-lane="then"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button></div></section>
                    <section class="else"><h4><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i> Senão</h4>{{#each elseSteps}}<div class="branch-step"><span>{{type}} — {{label}}</span><button type="button" data-action="delete-branch-step" data-index="{{../index}}" data-lane="else" data-branch-index="{{branchIndex}}"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button></div>{{/each}}<div class="branch-add"><select data-branch-step-type="{{index}}-else">{{#each ../stepTypes}}<option value="{{type}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="add-branch-step" data-index="{{index}}" data-lane="else"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button></div></section>
                  </div>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if isSetVariable}}
                  <label>Variável <input type="text" value="{{variable}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="variable"></label>
                  <label>Operação <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="operation" data-value="{{operation}}"><option value="set">Definir</option><option value="add">Somar</option><option value="subtract">Subtrair</option><option value="multiply">Multiplicar</option><option value="append">Adicionar à lista</option><option value="toggle">Alternar booleano</option></select></label>
                  <label>Tipo <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="valueType" data-value="{{valueType}}"><option value="auto">Automático</option><option value="string">Texto</option><option value="number">Número</option><option value="boolean">Booleano</option><option value="array">Lista</option><option value="formula">Fórmula de rolagem</option></select></label>
                  <label>Valor <input type="text" value="{{value}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="value"></label>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if isMutateSteps}}
                  <label>Ação <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="action" data-value="{{action}}"><option value="modify">Modificar</option><option value="remove">Remover</option><option value="replace">Substituir</option><option value="add">Adicionar</option></select></label>
                  <label>ID da etapa alvo <input type="text" value="{{targetId}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="targetId"></label>
                  <label>Habilitar etapa alvo <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="changes.enabled" data-value="{{changes.enabled}}" data-value-type="boolean-select"><option value="false">Não</option><option value="true">Sim</option></select></label>
                  <label>Tipo a adicionar/substituir <select data-mutation-step-type data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="step.type" data-value="{{step.type}}">{{#each ../stepTypes}}<option value="{{type}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if isRollStep}}
                  <fieldset class="macro-maker-message-style full">
                    <legend>Formatação da mensagem</legend>
                    <label>Fonte <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.font" data-value="{{messageStyle.font}}">{{#each ../messageFonts}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
                    <label>Tamanho (px) <input type="number" min="8" max="72" value="{{messageStyle.size}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.size" data-value-type="optional-number"></label>
                    <label>Cor <input type="text" placeholder="#ffffff" value="{{messageStyle.color}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.color" data-value-type="optional-string"></label>
                    <label>Alinhamento <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.align" data-value="{{messageStyle.align}}"><option value="left">Esquerda</option><option value="center">Centro</option><option value="right">Direita</option></select></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if messageStyle.bold}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.bold" data-value-type="boolean"> Negrito</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if messageStyle.italic}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.italic" data-value-type="boolean"> Itálico</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if messageStyle.underline}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="messageStyle.underline" data-value-type="boolean"> Sublinhado</label>
                    <div class="macro-maker-message-preview full" data-message-preview="{{index}}" aria-label="Prévia da mensagem"></div>
                    <label class="full checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" {{#if announceTargets}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="announceTargets" data-value-type="boolean"> Anexar quantidade e nomes dos alvos atingidos depois da mensagem (ex.: “Alvos atingidos (2): X, Y”)</label>
                    <fieldset class="macro-maker-speaker-style full">
                      <legend>Nome do usuário no chat</legend>
                      <label class="full">Complemento após o nome
                        <textarea rows="2" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerAppend" placeholder="Aldine destrói com sua lâmina" data-preserve-leading-newline>&#xfeff;{{speakerAppend}}</textarea>
                      </label>
                      <p class="full macro-maker-help-note">Isso preserva o nome original do token e anexa o texto. Você pode digitar a frase completa (ex.: “Aldine destrói com sua lâmina”) ou apenas o complemento (ex.: “ — destrói com sua lâmina”).</p>
                      <label>Fonte <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.font" data-value="{{speakerStyle.font}}">{{#each ../messageFonts}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
                      <label>Tamanho (px) <input type="number" min="8" max="72" value="{{speakerStyle.size}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.size" data-value-type="optional-number"></label>
                      <label>Cor <input type="text" placeholder="#ffffff" value="{{speakerStyle.color}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.color" data-value-type="optional-string"></label>
                      <label>Alinhamento <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.align" data-value="{{speakerStyle.align}}"><option value="left">Esquerda</option><option value="center">Centro</option><option value="right">Direita</option></select></label>
                      <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if speakerStyle.bold}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.bold" data-value-type="boolean"> Negrito</label>
                      <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if speakerStyle.italic}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.italic" data-value-type="boolean"> Itálico</label>
                      <label><input type="checkbox" {{#if speakerStyle.underline}}checked{{/if}} data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="speakerStyle.underline" data-value-type="boolean"> Sublinhado</label>
                    </fieldset>
                  </fieldset>
                {{/if}}

                {{#if isRemovePersistent}}
                  <label>Escopo <select data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="scope" data-value="{{scope}}"><option value="name">Nome</option><option value="step">Etapa</option><option value="source">Origem</option><option value="target">Alvo</option><option value="project">Projeto</option><option value="tag">Tag</option><option value="all">Todos do Macro Maker</option></select></label>
                  <label>Nome <input type="text" value="{{name}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="name"></label>
                  <label>ID da etapa <input type="text" value="{{stepId}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="stepId"></label>
                  <label>Tag <input type="text" value="{{tag}}" data-step-index="{{index}}" data-step-path="tag"></label>
                {{/if}}
              </div>
            </li>
          {{else}}
            <li class="empty">Adicione uma etapa para começar.</li>
          {{/each}}
        </ol>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="macro-maker-panel macro-maker-json" data-editor-panel="json" hidden>
      <div class="macro-maker-json-note">
        <i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i>
        Alterações válidas feitas aqui aparecem no editor visual sem remover propriedades desconhecidas.
        <button type="button" data-action="format-json"><i class="fas fa-align-left"></i> Validar e formatar</button>
      </div>
      <textarea name="projectJson" spellcheck="false" aria-label="JSON do projeto">{{projectJson}}</textarea>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
